  "title": "Symbotic Announces Date for Reporting Second Quarter Fiscal Year 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "WILMINGTON, Mass., April 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Symbotic Inc. (Nasdaq: SYM), a leader in A.I.-enabled robotics technology for the supply chain, today announced it will release second quarter fiscal year 2026 financial results after the market close on Wednesday, May 6, 2026.",
